                   <p><strong>Log information.</strong>When you use our services or view content provided by TCS, we automatically collect and store certain information in server logs. This includes details of how you used our service, such as your search queries, Internet protocol address, device event information such as crashes, system activity (for example when you joined a particular community, what posts you created/edited etc., any remarks by Admins on your activities), hardware settings, browser type and browser language, the date and time of your request and referral URL.</p> 
